  {
   "address": 32808,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Starts the scene: interrupts off, the bitmap off, the raster call to lift_frame ($8135), the engine's sprite placing off ($045A), and the VIC-II set from the list after the call."
  },
  {
   "address": 32830,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "vic_inline_writes's list, register and value: $D010=$00, $D01C=$FF, $D020=$00, $D015=$FF, $D017=$00, $D01D=$00, $D025=$0B, $D026=$0F, $D011=$3B, $D012=$F9, $D016=$18, $D018=$79, $D019=$FF, $D01A=$81, $D021=$00; $FF ends it."
  },
  {
   "address": 32861,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "All eight sprites grey ($0C) and frame $07 (the lamp at $41C0), at the places in lamp_places: two columns of four lamps. Then page 6 and the bitmap at $6000 are cleared and the bitmap comes on."
  },
  {
   "address": 32896,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The bitmap on; no key waiting ($0223 = 0); interrupts on."
  },
  {
   "address": 32899,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "After 63 frames, unpacks the first picture (lift_picture: screen $5C00, colour, and a hidden bitmap at $E000) and starts sfx_siren."
  },
  {
   "address": 32929,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The ride: the picture appears in the visible bitmap one pixel line every two frames, from the bottom character row up, copied from the hidden bitmap at $E000 (40 bytes a line, 8 apart); while it does, the lamps move up a line each time, so the lift seems to rise. 25 rows of 8 lines."
  },
  {
   "address": 32942,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "start_effect's argument: $3678 (sfx_siren)."
  },
  {
   "address": 32944,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each pass: two frames; the lamps' y each one line less (not below 0); then the 40 bytes of this pixel line."
  },
  {
   "address": 33032,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The next character row up: source and destination 320 bytes back."
  },
  {
   "address": 33061,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At the top: sfx_engine, 128 frames, then the second picture over the first (loader_picture: the speech balloon), and the engine loads the next stage at once (stage_skip), the Queen."
  },
  {
   "address": 33064,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "start_effect's argument: $38A4 (sfx_engine)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33066,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Waits 128 frames, unpacks loader_picture and jumps to stage_skip."
  },
  {
   "address": 33077,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The raster call: waits until the raster is above line $FA, then level_frame."
  },
  {
